          "id": "karma_e_protection",
          "summary": "Inspire briefly shields Karma or a targeted allied champion and grants bonus movement speed."
        }
      ],
      "kind": "ability",
      "purpose": "Recognize protection and speed that can help a target escape, approach or maintain a tether.",
      "slot": "E",
      "source_ids": [
        "wiki:inspire"
      ],
      "subject_id": "wiki:inspire",
      "title": "Inspire: shield and movement speed",
      "unsupported_claims": []
    },
    {
      "advanced_exceptions": [],
      "context_id": "wiki:mantra",
      "core_mechanics": [
        {
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "Inspire's shield is increased, and Inspire spreads to surrounding allied champions at reduced power.",
              "source_id": "wiki:defiance"
            },
            {
              "quote": "Mantra - Active: Inspire grants a bonus amount of shielding.Inspire spreads to surrounding allied champions, granting them a shield for 2.5 seconds and 15% bonus movement speed for 2 seconds.",
              "source_id": "wiki:defiance"
            }
          ],
          "id": "karma_defiance_group",
          "summary": "Defiance strengthens the primary shield and spreads reduced-power shielding and movement speed to surrounding allied champions."
        }
      ],
      "kind": "ability_variant",
      "purpose": "Recognize group protection and acceleration that can enable a coordinated approach or retreat.",
      "slot": "E",
      "source_ids": [
        "wiki:defiance"
      ],
      "subject_id": "wiki:defiance",
      "title": "Defiance: group shielding and speed",
      "unsupported_claims": []
    }
  ],
  "conflicts": [
    {
      "resolution": "Use qualitative damage effects. The appended change note is not treated as a current damage table.",
      "source_ids": [
        "wiki:Q",
        "wiki:soulflare"
      ],
      "topic": "Soulflare damage arrays coexist with a different appended primary-damage change note."
    },
    {
      "resolution": "Teach champion-hit cooldown reduction qualitatively from the dedicated live section and Riot description; omit exact reduction values.",
      "source_ids": [
        "wiki:P",
        "wiki:gatheringfire",
        "riot:P"
      ],
      "topic": "Gathering Fire's live description is mixed with an uncontextualized historical cooldown-reduction change line in wiki:P."
    }
  ],
  "factual_risks": [
    "The packet does not establish a current patch label; pinned Data Dragon numbering must not be converted into one.",
    "The absence of a dash or blink is an inference from the complete supplied active kit, not an explicit quoted mobility restriction.",
    "Renewal bug and unexpected-interaction notes are not established current mechanics; visual tether bugs, cast-cancellation bugs and rune interactions are excluded from core requirements.",
    "Lore, skins and collection text embedded in wiki:R do not describe combat mechanics.",
    "Exact damage, shielding, healing, cooldown and duration arrays are unnecessary for these recognition goals and may contain stale notes.",
    "This inventory is unapproved editorial material."
  ],
